---
config:
  theme: dark
title: SaveKeeper — Load Flow
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caller as Game Code
    participant GS as SaveKeeper
    participant Store as IStorageProvider
    participant Enc as IEncryptionProvider
    participant Ser as ISerializer
    participant Sav as Registered ISavables

    Caller->>GS: LoadAsync(profileId)

    rect rgba(0, 200, 100, 0.12)
        Note over GS, Store: 1. Read
        GS->>Store: ReadAsync(profileId, .sav)
        Store-->>GS: raw bytes
        Note right of Store: LoadBackupAsync reads<br/>.sav.bak instead
    end

    rect rgba(255, 165, 0, 0.12)
        Note over GS, Ser: 2. Decode
        opt UseEncryption
            GS->>Enc: Decrypt(raw)
            Note right of Enc: Verify HMAC first;<br/>throws on tamper
            Enc-->>GS: JSON
        end
        GS->>Ser: Deserialize(JSON)
        Ser-->>GS: SaveData (Meta + ObjectData + SimpleData)
    end

    rect rgba(0, 150, 255, 0.12)
        Note over GS, Sav: 3. Restore
        loop For each ISavable
            GS->>GS: lookup ObjectData by SaveKey
            opt Entry exists for this SaveKey
                GS->>Sav: RestoreData(data)
            end
        end
    end

    GS-->>Caller: Handle complete
    Note right of Caller: Load does not fire an event.<br/>Await the handle or subscribe to<br/>handle.Completed.
